{"3717060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Somnium", "steam_appid": 3717060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somnium” is a TPS action RPG in which players use their swords to defeat enemies and the bosses in each stage. While strengthening your own character in the boss-rush type dungeon, aim to clear the stage by using evasion, guarding, just guarding, jumping, and using drop items dropped by the boss. This work is for offline play. Get the skills you like, create your own character, defeat the bosses, become the champion of the dungeon, and escape from this eerie building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717060/extras/スクリーンショット_2025-05-14_173304.png?t=1776504880\" /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Somnium” is a TPS action RPG in which players use their swords to defeat enemies and the bosses in each stage. While strengthening your own character in the boss-rush type dungeon, aim to clear the stage by using evasion, guarding, just guarding, jumping, and using drop items dropped by the boss. This work is for offline play. Get the skills you like, create your own character, defeat the bosses, become the champion of the dungeon, and escape from this eerie building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3717060/extras/スクリーンショット_2025-05-14_173304.png?t=1776504880\" /></span></p>", "short_description": "“Somnium” is a TPS action RPG where you defeat enemies and advance by defeating bosses in each stage with your sword. Navigate boss rush-style dungeons while strengthening your character, aiming to clear stages through dodging, guarding, just guarding, and jumping.", "supported_languages": "Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.aka